cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use magpylib_jax in your research, please cite this repository. Please
  also cite the Magpylib paper (in `references`) whose analytic field models this
  project reimplements.
title: magpylib_jax
abstract: >-
  A JAX-native, end-to-end differentiable reimplementation of Magpylib for
  analytic magnetic field computation. It keeps Magpylib's object and functional
  APIs and closed-form field models while making them differentiable
  (jax.grad/jacfwd/jacrev), JIT-compilable, and vmap-friendly on CPU, GPU, and
  TPU, and adds autodiff force and torque (getFT).
type: software
authors:
